# Ignored CVEs for caddy-cloudflare-redis.
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, with a dated rationale above it.
# Revisit this file at every Caddy release bump.
#
# Scope: CVEs listed here are in Go dependencies compiled into the Caddy
# binary by upstream modules. Remove entries when upstream Caddy/modules
# ship fixed dependency versions.

# 2026-04-30 / iuliandita
# CRITICAL: grpc-go authz bypass via HTTP/2 path validation.
# Bundled via ACME/DNS libs. Fixed in grpc-go 1.79.3.
CVE-2026-33186

# 2026-04-30 / iuliandita
# CRITICAL: Step CA unauthenticated SCEP cert issuance.
# Bundled via smallstep/certificates v0.30.0-rc3. Fixed in 0.30.0.
# Caddy does not expose SCEP endpoints, so not reachable in this image.
CVE-2026-30836

# 2026-04-30 / iuliandita
# HIGH: go-jose DoS via crafted JWE. Fixed in 3.0.5 / 4.1.4.
# Caddy bundles both v3 and v4 via ACME libs. Single CVE ID covers both.
CVE-2026-34986
